addSectionHelp(playerPage, "Speed Helper", table.concat({
    "1) Turn the helper on.",
    "2) Equip a weapon and swing it (or just hold it).",
    "3) The script waits for a value starting with \"Speed\" inside your Currents folder and clones it as \"" .. CONFIG.SpeedCloneName .. "\".",
    "4) Once the clone exists the controls unlock: pick Speed up or Slow down and set the amount (0-" .. CONFIG.SpeedLimit .. ").",
